<th>Aftermarket Available?</th>
<th>Recommendation</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Bearings</td>
<td>No</td>
<td>Yes, when bore, housing dimensions, and seals match</td>
<td>Aftermarket, match size and type</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Motors</td>
<td>No</td>
<td>Yes, match frame, HP, RPM, voltage</td>
