<td>Yes, requires reprogramming</td>
<td>Aftermarket acceptable; keep parameter backup</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Fabric Belting</td>
<td>No</td>
<td>Yes, multiple belt manufacturers</td>
<td>Aftermarket, match material, width, surface</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Modular Plastic Belt</td>
<td>Usually yes</td>
<td>Limited, pitch and module must match exactly</td>
<td>Original belt manufacturer for that series</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>MDR Rollers</td>
<td>Yes</td>
